## Statement

An operator can define speed zones (name, limit) and see the list update
without a reload.

## Rationale

The customer's enforcement contract bills per zone; zones must be
operator-managed, not deploy-managed.

## Acceptance

- Creating a zone with a duplicate name is refused with `zone.exists`.
- The list shows a created zone within one refresh interval.

## Clarifications

- 2026-01-01 — Q: May zones overlap? A: Yes — enforcement picks the lower
  limit. (ruled by the owner)
- open: Is there a maximum zone count per tenant?

